[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0010","text":"到底放哪儿去了呢～……\n喂～！快出来～！镜子～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0020","text":"叫它也不会出来的，\n好好回忆一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0030","text":"……\n椅子下面没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0040","text":"（这种时候……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0004","text":"一起喊它"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0005","text":"告诉我有什么特征"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_00_0006","text":"从高处\n找找看吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_01_0010","text":"喂～！快出来～！\n爱依的镜子～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_01_0020","text":"哈……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_02_0010","text":"呃……是粉色的……\n装饰得闪闪发亮的那种～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_02_0020","text":"那个的话我在练习场见过\n去拿吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_03_0010","text":"原来如此……。那制作人，\n把我扛在肩上！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05100000_03_0020","text":"等、不用做到那种程度吧……？\n摔下来多危险"}]
